  "label": "four individuals dressed in Ku Klux Klan robes",
  "description": "Four people standing side-by-side, wearing white hooded robes with pointed hoods and black circular emblems on the chest. Their faces are obscured by the hoods and masks. They appear to be posing for a photograph, likely from the early 20th century, given the black-and-white film quality and the biplane visible in the background. The robes are tied at the waist with ropes or cords. The visual material is historically significant and carries strong connotations of white supremacist violence.",
